  "purpose": "Screen-used Stargate Atlantis Wraith commander/hunter clothing translated to RimWorld's vanilla Duster family: a long green-black leather trenchcoat over a black reptile-leather vest, layered textured epaulettes, concealed snaps/zipper, side/back lacing, dark blue satin lining and production wear. It must read first as Stargate wardrobe, not as segmented sci-fi armour.",
